  "evidence": "TEXT_G: Repeal the European Communities Act and restore UK legal primacy; regain independent representation at bodies like the WTO; systematic deregulation including removing the Working Time Directive; immediate tax cuts and simplification (halve council tax, abolish 10% income tax band, raise inheritance tax threshold); strengthen law and order (clear sentencing minima/maxima, build prisons, protect homeowners); near zero net immigration with points-based system, strict refugee criteria, and embarkation controls; increase defence spending, reverse force cuts, prioritize domestic procurement, maintain NATO alignment; reassert control over UK waters. TEXT_C: Strongly progressive taxation and new corporation tax bands; universal Citizen’s Income and Citizen’s Pension; expand NHS entitlements (abolish prescription charges, restore dental/eye care); reduce defence spending and decommission nuclear weapons; uphold refugee rights and expand asylum protections; extensive constitutional reforms (PR, fully elected upper chamber, disestablish state church, limit monarchy); devolve power and oppose ID cards; expansive environmental/food policies emphasizing bans/precaution (ban GM food, organics target, zero-waste, stricter chemicals).",
